ill post my quick review...
pros:
-nice graphics;
-good story line (still being  developed today!);
-lots of playable characters(warframes);
-lots of weapons;
-more stuff i dont remember xd;
cons:
-grindy system where u can have most if not all stuff from the game if u grind enough materials and even trade with players on dojo;
-you might need to spend some money on game to buy stuff faster or speed up crafting ( then again, you can trade real money currency with in-game itens if you trade with players.)
-Most of the times you will have to farm on the same map over and over for recources (can get very tedious, but that's why people have lots of hours in this game XD )
-More stuff i dont remember again xd;
overall: very grindy game that gives the possibily to have everything without spending a dime, but you will need to wait and grind alot for that to happen , i recommend buying Platinum (real money currency) when you get a 75% discount.

