Don't buy this game, unless you are willing to:
- Play an unplayable game;
- 40 hour rollbacks at almost every update;
- Suffer with stupid lag on ALL SERVERS (no matter your ping, it will always lag, and your character will die);
- Mass disconnection from the server at crucial times. You are on your jorney to farm something, or even attacking something, and BAM...you get disconnected. If you are on a boat, gg, your character suffers a stupid rollback-lag when you disconnect from the server, that it get drowned and you die before you get back online. You are flying with your dino? BAM, you fall from it, and get r4p3d by dinos or other players, and your dino dies alone on the woods.
- Monopolization of areas of the server by older players (the Alpha tribes - every server has one). So, if you want a mineral on a cave? I'm sorry, the entrance is full of high-tech advanced turrets from an older fellow which already spent 3500 hours playing before you. Need a drop or anything that is rare? Nop. It's already taken by someone stronger.
- Get raided. Get raided. Get raided. Get raided, and NEVER find out who did it. Because the game doesn't identify who broke into your base and ♥♥♥♥ed your hard work.
So, if you still like dinossaurs, don't buy this game. That's why the dinos got extinct, they would throw up of despair if they see this crapy-broken-unfair game.
Unfortunately, I played 100 hours of this, to find out how stupid this is, and i cant get my money back.

